cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the paper and this archive."
title: "Fungal communities of karee malformation disease in Searsia lancea: analysis code and data"
type: software
license: MIT
version: "1.1.0"
abstract: >-
  Code, parameters, phylogenetic placement files and summary data for an ITS2 amplicon study of the
  fungal communities of karee malformation disease in Searsia lancea, including an unresolved lineage
  provisionally assigned to Tremellomycetes and six documented analytical failure modes.
keywords:
  - Searsia lancea
  - karee malformation disease
  - ITS2 amplicon metabarcoding
  - Tremellomycetes
  - QIIME 2
